GloryFit / UTE protocol
-----------------------
Watch Sync talks to GloryFit- and UTE-family watches using command opcodes,
record layouts, and fetch/handshake behaviour adapted from Gadgetbridge's
GloryFit support:

  https://codeberg.org/Freeyourgadget/Gadgetbridge
  app/src/main/java/nodomain/freeyourgadget/gadgetbridge/service/devices/gloryfit/

Gadgetbridge is copyright its contributors, including José Rebelo (2025),
and is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.

The UTE command dialect (writes to 0x34F1, opcodes such as EB for steps and
EC for sleep) is documented in Gadgetbridge issue #5505 and in the
Gadgetbridge-tools GloryFit dissector:

  https://codeberg.org/Freeyourgadget/Gadgetbridge/issues/5505
  https://codeberg.org/Freeyourgadget/Gadgetbridge-tools/src/branch/main/gloryfit

Those sources are also AGPL-3.0.
